@Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress = https://localhost:7256
@customerId=143

### GetCustomers

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers
Accept: application/json

### GetCustomerById

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json


### GetCustomerSales

GET {{Atc.Kusto.Api.Sample_HostAddress}}/customer-sales
Accept: application/json

